 Line Terminal (OLT)","c":[]},{"h":"GPON Ports: 2 x GPON","c":[]},{"h":"Uplink Ports: Gigabit Ethernet Uplink (Model Dependent)","c":[]},{"h":"GPON Standard: ITU-T G.984.x","c":[]},{"h":"Layer Features: VLAN, STP, RSTP, MSTP, QoS, ACL","c":[]},{"h":"Network Protocol: IPv4 / IPv6","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The KingType GPT-C212V 2-Port GPON OLT is a compact, high-performance Optical Line Terminal (OLT) designed for FTTH (Fiber to the Home), FTTB (Fiber to the Building), FTTO (Fiber to the Office), and enterprise fiber access networks. Built for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), telecom operators, and enterprise deployments, it delivers stable GPON connectivity with high bandwidth, low latency, and reliable network performance.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring 2 GPON PON ports, the GPT-C212V supports centralized ONU management through OMCI, making deployment and maintenance simple and efficient. Its advanced Layer 2 switching capabilities include VLAN, QoS, ACL, IGMP Snooping, DHCP Relay, multicast management, and comprehensive security features to ensure smooth broadband and IPTV service delivery.</p><p><br></p><p>With its 1U rack-mount design, user-friendly web interface, CLI, and SNMP management support, the KingType GPT-C212V is an excellent solution for small to medium-sized GPON networks requiring scalability, reliability, and cost-effective fiber access.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you're expanding an ISP network or building a new FTTH infrastructure, the KingType GPT-C212V offers dependable performance and enterprise-grade management features.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>2 GPON PON Ports</li><li>Compliant with ITU-T GPON Standards</li><li>High-Speed GPON Transmission</li><li>Supports FTTH, FTTB, FTTO &amp; Triple-Play Services</li><li>Advanced Layer 2 Switching</li><li>OMCI-Based ONU Auto Discovery &amp; Remote Management</li><li>VLAN, QoS, ACL &amp; DHCP Relay Support</li><li>IGMP Snooping &amp; Multicast Management</li><li>Web GUI, CLI, SNMP &amp; Telnet Management</li><li>IPv4 &amp; IPv6 Ready</li><li>1U Rack-Mount Design</li><li>High Reliability and Carrier-Grade Stability</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600G1-B 8 Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g1-b-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"125,000৳","old":"128,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GS-F Single PON GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gs-f-single-pon-gpon-olt","now":"33,000৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GT 2-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gt-2-port-gpon-olt","now":"54,000৳","old":"57,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G2-B 16-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g2-b-16-port-gpon-olt","now":"226,000৳","old":"230,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G0-B 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g0-b-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"87,000৳","old":"89,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM Scalable 8 port with 4 PON port E08GPS-2S+ GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-scalable-8-port-with-4-pon-port-e08gps-2s-gpon-olt","now":"68,000৳","old":"71,300৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G08L 8-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g08l-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G04L 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g04l-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"71,000৳","old":"73,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E01GP-S+ 1-PON Port GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-e01gp-s-1-pon-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"28,000৳"},{"name":"KingType GPT-C224V 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/kingtype-gpt-c224v-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/kingtype-gpna